WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.251
Have you seen all these protests

00:00:01.251 --> 00:00:03.420
around the world supporting Palestine?

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:04.796
Even after these abhorrent attacks

00:00:04.796 --> 00:00:06.715
by Hamas on Israeli civilians.

00:00:06.715 --> 00:00:07.590
It's an important reminder

00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:08.258
that the movement

00:00:08.258 --> 00:00:10.176
for the liberation of Palestinians

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:12.012
is very different than this violent

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:13.805
terrorizing group called Hamas.

00:00:13.805 --> 00:00:15.181
The vast majority of Palestinians

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:16.182
are not Hamas.

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:17.434
They simply want freedom

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:18.852
and dignity and autonomy.

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:21.354
And yet their land has been sliced up,

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:22.022
built on

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:22.480
and is under

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:24.274
constant control and surveillance

00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:26.484
by Israeli military and citizens.

00:00:26.484 --> 00:00:27.777
When I was reporting in the West Bank,

00:00:27.777 --> 00:00:28.737
I saw that

00:00:28.737 --> 00:00:30.572
this is also a form of violence.

00:00:30.572 --> 00:00:31.406
It is a quieter

00:00:31.406 --> 00:00:32.449
and less flashy

00:00:32.449 --> 00:00:33.241
form of violence,

00:00:33.241 --> 00:00:34.576
it doesn’t make the same kind of news,

00:00:34.576 --> 00:00:36.244
but it is violence nonetheless.

00:00:36.244 --> 00:00:36.703
And yet it in

00:00:36.703 --> 00:00:37.912
no way justifies

00:00:37.912 --> 00:00:39.080
what Hamas has done

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:40.290
in launching these attacks.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:41.541
These protests remind us

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:42.500
that there is a bigger,

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.627
more legitimate movement at play here

00:00:44.627 --> 00:00:46.004
one that should not be conflated

00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:46.963
with Hamas

00:00:46.963 --> 00:00:48.214
and their horrible actions

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:49.174
in the last few days.

